## Styling Conventions (Tailwind CSS v4)

### CSS Import
```css
@import "tailwindcss";
```

### Tailwind v4 Notes
- Tailwind v4 uses `@import "tailwindcss"` instead of directives
- Classes with `@apply` should be in separate CSS files
- Use utility classes directly in JSX

### Common Patterns
```tsx
// Responsive
<div className="hidden sm:block">

// Hover effects
<button className="hover:underline transition-all">

// Flexbox
<div className="flex items-center justify-between">

// Grid
<div className="grid grid-cols-2 gap-4">

// Spacing
<div className="p-4 m-2 px-5">

// Typography
<span className="font-bold text-lg antialiased">

// Colors
<span className="text-blue-600 bg- gray-100">
```

### Custom CSS Classes
Defined in `app/globals.css`:
```css
.fade-in { animation: fadeIn 0.5s ease both; }
.btn-primary { background-color: #2563eb; color: white; padding: 0.5rem 1rem; }
```

